  "_id": "Jn2Qg8FzHzCP1A2f",
  "name": "无重力板甲 Plate Armor of Weightlessness (BMT)",
  "type": "equipment",
  "system": {
    "source": {
      "custom": "",
      "book": "BMT",
      "page": "65",
      "license": "",
      "rules": "2014",
      "revision": 1
    },
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>护甲（重甲），非普通（需同调）</em></p><p>这套护甲具有5发充能。穿着这套护甲期间，你可以用附赠动作消耗1发充能来用这套护甲，以自己为目标施展以下法术之一：<em>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack.spell.Item.1B8U6kl0egesx3FK]{跳跃术 Jump}</em>（1充能）或<em>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack.spell.Item.GNvrHluGdgqD06wZ]{浮空术 Levitate}</em> （2充能）。</p><p>这套护甲在每日黎明时分恢复[[/r 1d4 + 1]]发已被消耗的充能数。</p><p>板甲由覆盖全身，且相互连接的模铸金属板组成。一套板甲包括护手、重皮靴、一顶附面甲的头盔以及在护甲底层的厚重的布甲。其锁扣和皮带结构可以将护甲重量分配到身体各处。</p><p>This armor has 5 charges. While you wear it, you can use a bonus action to expend 1 or more charges to cast one of the following spells from the armor, targeting yourself: @spell[Jump] (1 charge) or @spell[Levitate] (2 charges).</p><p>This armor regains [[/r 1d4 + 1]] expended charges daily at dawn.</p><p>Plate consists of shaped, interlocking metal plates to cover the entire body. A suit of plate includes gauntlets, heavy leather boots, a visored helmet, and thick layers of padding underneath the armor. Buckles and straps distribute the weight over the body.</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
